#: ../../workflows/workflows.rst:18
msgid "Regardless of whether or not it's one of the the workflows listed, it is **strongly** recommended that you make a backup copy of the files being processed and initially process a copy of your music files. This will help to ensure that Picard is properly configured (e.g.: settings, scripts, and plugins) and produces the expected and desired results."
msgstr ""
"无论是否为列出的工作流之一，都**强烈**建议你对正在处理的文件制作备份副本，并"
"首先处理你的音乐文件副本。这将有助于确保 Picard 正确配置（例如：设置、脚本和"
"插件），并产生预期和期望的结果。"
